            "review_title": "Review at Nomu",
            "review_text": "jlopez0488\nKansas City, Missouri2 contributions\n0\nGreat space! Even better food\nNov 2019\nAmazing, powerful and distinct flavors! The flavors are truly unparalleled. Some of the recipes—I'm thinking specifically of the brioche with cheese inside—are dishes I'd come back for again.\n\nThe music is realy nice, really hip and relaxed. I liked how minimal the decor was. It really allowed me to focus on the food and drink. This is the right approach. The bartender was also very responsive and friendly not to mention quick.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 29, 2019",
