            "review_text": "Quynh Huong H\n9 contributions\n2\nBeyond my expectation:D\nNov 2019 • Friends\nI had a great time over the dinner at Nomu with my friends. Chill vibe, tasty food, well-decoration, great cocktails, cheesecake and friendly staffs.. I can’t ask for more :D \nP/s: I strongly recommend the set menu, it’s all in one ;))))\nWritten November 26, 2019",
